extends layout

block styles

block scripts

block content
  header
    h1= title
  main
    section
      h2 Documentation
      p This is the main page of the decker quizzer backend.
      p You can find the client page <a href="./client">here</a>.
      section
        h3 API
        section
          h4 <code>/api/session</code>
          p A host can create a new quiz session by sending an empty <code>POST</code> request.
          section
            h5 Response
            p The response is the public id of the new session as well as a secret to identify yourself as its host.
            pre
              code
                | {
                |   id: id,
                |   secret: secret
                | }
        section
          h4 <code>/api/session/:id/question
          p A host can set the question of the current session by sending a <code>POST</code> request with the following content:
          section
            h5 Request
            p The request must contain both the secret of the session as well as a new question object.
            pre
              code
                | {
                |   secret: string,
                |   question: {}
                | }
